    "en": {
      "trackName": "Tic Tac Toe: X and O",
      "description": "Tic Tac Toe brings the familiar X-and-O board to your Apple devices with a colorful, focused design. Start a quick round or settle in for a tougher challenge.\n\nPLAY YOUR WAY\n\n• Challenge the computer at Relaxed, Strategic, or No Mercy difficulty.  \n• Use Pass & Play for two players on one device.  \n• Find turn-based online matches through Game Center.  \n• View Game Center leaderboards.\n\nPLAY ACROSS APPLE DEVICES\n\nEnjoy the game on iPhone and iPad, and play genuine rounds on Apple Watch.\n\nMADE TO FIT YOU\n\nClear controls keep X, O, turns, and scores easy to follow. Sound and haptic feedback add character on supported devices. VoiceOver, Dynamic Type, and Reduce Motion support help you play in the way that works best for you.\n\nFeatures may vary by device. Online play requires Game Center and a network connection.",
      "releaseNotes": "Now available with localized menus and gameplay text for more players around the world. This update also includes interface and accessibility refinements across supported Apple devices.",
      "trackViewUrl": "https://apps.apple.com/us/app/tic-tac-toe-x-and-o/id961392072?uo=4",
